# World 3 with WinUAE's smaller chip (tests/chipwinuae.agk's squeeze: Ctrl+L, Q takes 23 KB away for the run). World 3's art, gradients
# and strip ring live in the shared world arena, so with the squeeze every allocation must still be made, the strip must fill and
# the pilot must fly, and the floor of the game, 64 KB (SPEC 2), must hold.
wait-serial "AGK t0" 3000
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x10
wait 30
expect-serial "AGK chip squeezed"
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x07
wait-serial "AGK world 3 loaded" 400
wait 90
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x03
wait 30
press fire 2
wait 60
press up 40
hold right
wait 200
screenshot squeezed
release
expect-no-serial "AGK ERR|missing|out of chip"
expect-no-dropped-frames
expect-min-chip-free 64
